# Walkthrough - Phase 11: Android Mobile App Capacitor Sync

Phase 11 configures the full Capacitor Android build pipeline so the Next.js app compiles to a static bundle and syncs directly into the native Android project at `frontend/android/`, ready for Android Studio to compile into a `com.rrstationery.erp` APK.

## Key Changes Made

### 1. Static Export — [next.config.js](file:///c:/Users/jagan/Downloads/smart-stationery-erp-phase1/frontend/next.config.js)
- Added `output: "export"` so `next build` produces a fully static `out/` directory.
- Added `trailingSlash: true` so routes like `/dashboard` resolve to `dashboard/index.html` inside the APK assets.

### 2. Capacitor Configuration — [capacitor.config.ts](file:///c:/Users/jagan/Downloads/smart-stationery-erp-phase1/frontend/capacitor.config.ts)
- `server.androidScheme: "https"` — ensures cookies and `fetch()` calls work correctly inside the Capacitor WebView.
- `SplashScreen` plugin config — dark `#0d0b09` background matching the ERP theme, auto-hides after 1.5 s.
- `android.allowMixedContent: false` — enforces HTTPS on all production network calls.
- `android.captureInput: true` — improves keyboard handling on Android.

### 3. NPM Scripts — [package.json](file:///c:/Users/jagan/Downloads/smart-stationery-erp-phase1/frontend/package.json)
| Script | Command | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| `cap:sync` | `next build && npx cap sync android` | Full export + asset sync in one step |
| `cap:open` | `npx cap open android` | Opens project in Android Studio |

### 4. Android Manifest — [AndroidManifest.xml](file:///c:/Users/jagan/Downloads/smart-stationery-erp-phase1/frontend/android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml)
New permissions added for future POS hardware features:
- `CAMERA` — barcode / QR code scanning
- `VIBRATE` — payment success haptic feedback
- `USE_BIOMETRIC` / `USE_FINGERPRINT` — biometric PIN login
- `android:usesCleartextTraffic="false"` — no HTTP in production
- `android:windowSoftInputMode="adjustResize"` — keyboard doesn't overlap input fields

### 5. Network Security Config — [network_security_config.xml](file:///c:/Users/jagan/Downloads/smart-stationery-erp-phase1/frontend/android/app/src/main/res/xml/network_security_config.xml)
- Blocks all cleartext HTTP in production.
- Whitelists `localhost` and `10.0.2.2` (Android emulator loopback) for Capacitor live-reload in development.

### 6. Version Bump — [build.gradle](file:///c:/Users/jagan/Downloads/smart-stationery-erp-phase1/frontend/android/app/build.gradle)
- `versionCode 2`, `versionName "1.1.0"`.

